{"seq":3,"slug":"parallel-compute","title":"并行计算与分片：把大任务切开喂满多核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/patterns/parallel-compute","wordCount":1499,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"并行计算与分片-把大任务切开喂满多核\">并行计算与分片：把大任务切开喂满多核</h1><p>一根 Worker 把计算挪出了主线程，但它仍然只用一个 CPU 核心——你的笔记本明明有 8 核，却只有一根线程在干活。当任务是「对一百万个元素做同一种处理」这类可分割的负载时，真正的加速来自把数据切片、分发给多根 Worker 同时算、再把结果归并。这就是数据并行（data parallelism）的分而治之，也是 Worker 从「不卡 UI」升级到「快好几倍」的关键一跃。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数据并行的前提是任务可被切成互不依赖的子任务。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 元素的数据集被切成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 片，每片交给池里一根 Worker 独立处理，最后主线程（或某根 Worker）把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 份部分结果归并成最终结果。这是经典的 map-reduce 形态：map 阶段并行算各片，reduce 阶段合并。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[大数据集 n 个元素] --&gt; B[切片成 k 片]&#10;  B --&gt; C1[Worker 1 算片 1]&#10;  B --&gt; C2[Worker 2 算片 2]&#10;  B --&gt; C3[Worker k 算片 k]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D[归并部分结果]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D&#10;  C3 --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[最终结果]\">flowchart TD\n  A[大数据集 n 个元素] --&gt; B[切片成 k 片]\n  B --&gt; C1[Worker 1 算片 1]\n  B --&gt; C2[Worker 2 算片 2]\n  B --&gt; C3[Worker k 算片 k]\n  C1 --&gt; D[归并部分结果]\n  C2 --&gt; D\n  C3 --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[最终结果]</pre><p>这套模式直接架在 <a href=\"worker-pool\">Worker 池</a> 之上——池提供并行执行的载体，本篇提供切分与归并的算法。切片的数据通过 <a href=\"../communication/transferable-objects\">可转移对象</a> 零拷贝下发（注意每片必须是独立 buffer，否则转移第一片后其余为空），结果再传回归并。能否并行的判据很简单：子任务之间没有数据依赖、没有共享可变状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"amdahl-定律-并行能加速多少\">Amdahl 定律：并行能加速多少</h2><p>并行不是线程越多越快，存在硬上限。Amdahl 定律刻画了这个上限：设程序中可并行部分的比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>（串行部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>），用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 根线程，理论加速比为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mi>k</mi></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(k) = \\frac{1}{(1-p) + \\dfrac{p}{k}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.005em;vertical-align:-1.6836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1076em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3376em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1076em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7846em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.1076em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>关键洞见藏在极限里：哪怕线程无限多（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k \\to \\infty</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span></span></span></span></span>），加速比也被串行部分卡死在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{1-p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3262em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。如果一个任务只有 90% 可并行（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span>），无论开多少核，最多也只能快 10 倍。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>可并行比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>4 线程加速</th>\n<th>8 线程加速</th>\n<th>理论上限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>1.6×</td>\n<td>1.8×</td>\n<td>2×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.9</td>\n<td>3.1×</td>\n<td>4.7×</td>\n<td>10×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.95</td>\n<td>3.5×</td>\n<td>6.0×</td>\n<td>20×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.99</td>\n<td>3.9×</td>\n<td>7.5×</td>\n<td>100×</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对 Worker 而言，「串行部分」不只是算法里的串行段，还包括切片、postMessage 往返、归并这些并行化引入的额外开销——这正是下一节要算的账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"切片粒度-太粗吃不满-太细全是开销\">切片粒度：太粗吃不满，太细全是开销</h2><p>切多少片是个甜区问题。片太少（比如只切 2 片却有 8 核），多余的核闲着，吃不满硬件；片太多太碎，每片的固定开销（消息往返、序列化、调度）累加起来，反而拖慢整体。设单片计算耗时为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、单次跨线程往返开销为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>≫</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_c \\gg t_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时分片才划算。</p>\n<p>实践经验法则：片数取池大小的 1～4 倍，让每根 Worker 拿到一到几片，既填满所有核又给负载均衡留余地（先算完的 Worker 能接下一片，避免「一片巨慢拖垮全局」的长尾）。对极不均匀的负载（不同片耗时差异大），动态分片（把数据切成比线程多得多的小片、让池按完成顺序领取）比静态均分更抗长尾。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"// 静态均分 + 转移&#10;const k = pool.size;&#10;const slice = Math.ceil(arr.length / k);&#10;const parts = await Promise.all(&#10;  Array.from({ length: k }, (_, i) =&gt; {&#10;    const chunk = arr.slice(i * slice, (i + 1) * slice); // 独立 buffer&#10;    return pool.exec({ chunk }, [chunk.buffer]);&#10;  }),&#10;);&#10;const result = parts.reduce(merge); // 归并\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 静态均分 + 转移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const k = pool.size;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const slice = Math.ceil(arr.length / k);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const parts = await Promise.all(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Array.from({ length: k }, (_, i) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const chunk = arr.slice(i * slice, (i + 1) * slice); // 独立 buffer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return pool.exec({ chunk }, [chunk.buffer]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const result = parts.reduce(merge); // 归并</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"归并阶段与共享内存的取舍\">归并阶段与共享内存的取舍</h2><p>归并阶段常被忽视，但它可能成为新瓶颈。如果每片结果都很大、要拷回主线程再合并，那归并的 postMessage 开销可能吃掉并行省下的时间——这又回到 Amdahl 里的「串行额外开销」。两种缓解：让 reduce 也并行（树形归并，两两合并）；或干脆用 <a href=\"../communication/shared-array-buffer\">SharedArrayBuffer 与 Atomics</a> 让所有 Worker 把结果直接写进同一块共享内存的不同区段，省掉结果回传。后者尤其适合「输出是个大数组、各 Worker 写不重叠区段」的场景（如并行图像滤镜：每根 Worker 处理图像的不同扫描线区域）。</p>\n<p>典型落地场景：大数据集的并行聚合/排序、图像与视频逐像素滤镜、物理与粒子模拟、加密哈希批处理、地理数据的并行计算。数据可视化里对海量数据点的预处理也常走这条路，与 <a href=\"../../frontend-data-visualization/\">前端数据可视化(49)</a> 的大数据渲染相邻。若计算热点本身是数值密集型，把每片的算法用 Wasm 实现再放进 Worker 并行，是 Worker + Wasm 的经典组合，详见 <a href=\"../../webassembly/typescript-integration/performance-boundaries\">WebAssembly(10)</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时并行-何时别折腾\">何时并行、何时别折腾</h2><ul>\n<li>数据量大、单元素处理独立、且总计算时间远超切分+往返开销 → <strong>值得并行</strong>。</li>\n<li>可并行比例低（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 小）→ Amdahl 告诉你天花板很低，未必值得引入复杂度。</li>\n<li>数据量小、或往返开销与计算量相当 → 单 Worker 甚至主线程切片足矣。</li>\n<li>子任务间有强依赖、需频繁同步 → 数据并行不适用，强行拆只会被同步开销淹没。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>并行计算是 Worker 能力的上限演出，但也是复杂度的上限——是否值得，要把 Amdahl 的天花板和切分开销一起放进 <a href=\"../practice/worker-when-to-use\">选型与边界</a> 的账里算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>数据并行把可分割的大任务切片分发给多根 Worker 同时算、再归并，是 map-reduce 在前端的落地。</li>\n<li>Amdahl 定律给出硬上限：加速比被串行部分卡死在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{1-p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3262em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，线程再多也突破不了。</li>\n<li>切片粒度有甜区：太粗吃不满核，太细被往返开销吃掉；片数取池大小 1～4 倍，长尾负载用动态分片。</li>\n<li>归并阶段可能成新瓶颈：用树形并行归并，或用 SharedArrayBuffer 让各 Worker 写不重叠区段省回传。</li>\n<li>仅当数据大、子任务独立、计算远超切分开销时才值得并行；强依赖或低并行比例时别折腾。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 内：<a href=\"worker-pool\">Worker 池</a> — 并行执行的载体；<a href=\"../communication/shared-array-buffer\">SharedArrayBuffer 与 Atomics</a> — 省掉结果回传的共享内存；<a href=\"../communication/transferable-objects\">可转移对象</a> — 切片零拷贝下发。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../webassembly/typescript-integration/performance-boundaries\">WebAssembly(10) · 性能边界</a> — 用 Wasm 加速每片计算；<a href=\"../../frontend-data-visualization/\">前端数据可视化(49)</a> — 海量数据点的并行预处理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"并行计算与分片：把大任务切开喂满多核","id":"并行计算与分片-把大任务切开喂满多核"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Amdahl 定律：并行能加速多少","id":"amdahl-定律-并行能加速多少"},{"level":2,"text":"切片粒度：太粗吃不满，太细全是开销","id":"切片粒度-太粗吃不满-太细全是开销"},{"level":2,"text":"归并阶段与共享内存的取舍","id":"归并阶段与共享内存的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"何时并行、何时别折腾","id":"何时并行-何时别折腾"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"RPC 与 Comlink：把 postMessage 写成本地调用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/patterns/comlink-rpc"},"next":{"title":"框架集成：让构建工具与组件认得 Worker","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-web-workers-offloading/practice/worker-framework-integration"}}